<% content_for :title, "about" %>
<p class="prompt">man rubybits</p>
<pre>
NAME
       rubybits — interactive ruby learning environment

SYNOPSIS
       open https://rubybits.local

DESCRIPTION
       rubybits ships short lessons grouped into modules, with
       runnable activities checked by a sandboxed ruby subprocess.
       progress is tracked per user; badges and streaks reward
       consistent practice.

AUTHORS
       helmedeiros and contributors. PRs welcome.

SEE ALSO
       irb(1), ruby(1), pickaxe(7)
</pre>
